a&␀␀Parses a roster document. Returns (entrant ids, extra settings).

    Two accepted shapes:

        - jacco:house            a plain list of entrant ids (always supported)
        - brock:chaos

        roster:                  a mapping, which may also carry seeds/perfect
          - jacco:house
        seeds: 4

    The mapping form needs PyYAML. STDLIB ONLY is the rule here, so when PyYAML
    is not importable the mapping form is REFUSED with that reason rather than
    half-parsed - the plain list stays available and is enough for S1.
    Nr␀␀␀Ú#r␀␀␀z- Ú:zl: PyYAML is not importable, so only the plain-list roster form ('- <char>:<bot>' per line) is accepted; got é␀␀␀z: no entrants)
