    loop applies, so a plateau cannot be wandered across at either level.Nc␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀óV␀␀—␀|rt␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|«␀␀␀␀␀␀nd␀|␀_␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀||␀_␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀i␀|␀_␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r{|␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀j	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀«␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r`t␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀d¬«␀␀␀␀␀␀«␀␀␀␀␀␀}|j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀di␀«␀␀␀␀␀␀|␀_␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|€|j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀d«␀␀␀␀␀␀|␀_␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀y␀y␀y␀y␀)Nr&␀␀␀rF␀␀␀rÛ␀␀␀Úcomparability)	r␀␀␀r:␀␀␀râ␀␀␀ÚentriesrG␀␀␀rA␀␀␀rŸ␀␀␀rL␀␀␀ru␀␀␀)rW␀␀␀r:␀␀␀râ␀␀␀Údocs␀␀␀    r$␀␀␀rY␀␀␀zHeightArchive.__init__Ï␀␀sˆ␀␀␀€␀á"&”D˜”J¨DˆŒ	ØˆŒØ24ˆŒØ9Š9˜Ÿ™×)Ñ)Ô+Ü—*‘*˜TŸY™Y×0Ñ0¸'Ð0ÓBÓCˆCØŸ7™7 9¨bÓ1ˆDŒLØˆ{ØŸ7™7 ?Ó3•ð␀ð␀,ˆ9r#␀␀␀c␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ób␀␀␀—␀|␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀d«␀␀␀␀␀␀€y|d␀␀␀|␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀k(␀␀S␀)Nr␀␀T)râ␀␀␀ru␀␀␀)rW␀␀␀r¸␀␀␀s␀␀␀  r$␀␀␀Ú_comparablezHeightArchive._comparableÚ␀␀s1␀␀␀€␀Ø8‰8Ð˜uŸy™y¨Ó9ÐAØØ_Ñ%¨¯©Ñ1Ð1r#␀␀␀c␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀óv␀␀␀—␀|␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|«␀␀␀␀␀␀«␀␀␀␀␀␀}||␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|«␀␀␀␀␀␀sy␀|S␀r¬␀␀␀)r␀␀ru␀␀␀r§␀␀␀r␀␀)rW␀␀␀rÍ␀␀␀r¸␀␀␀s␀␀␀   r$␀␀␀Úbest_atzHeightArchive.best_atß␀␀s4␀␀␀€␀Ø—‘× Ñ ¤ V£Ó-ˆØˆ= × 0Ñ 0°Ô 7ØØˆr#␀␀␀c␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ó@␀␀␀—␀|␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|«␀␀␀␀␀␀}|d␀u␀xs␀||d␀␀␀k␀␀S␀)Nr„␀␀␀)r␀␀)rW␀␀␀rÍ␀␀␀r„␀␀␀Úbests␀␀␀    r$␀␀␀Úbetter_thanzHeightArchive.better_thanå␀␀s(␀␀␀€␀Ø|‰|˜FÓ#ˆØtˆ|Ò4˜u t¨G¡}Ñ4Ð4r#␀␀␀c␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀óT␀␀␀—␀|||||␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀dœ|␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀|«␀␀␀␀␀␀<␀␀␀y␀)N)rÍ␀␀␀r„␀␀␀r_␀␀␀r␀␀␀r␀␀)râ␀␀␀r␀␀r§␀␀␀)rW␀␀␀rÍ␀␀␀r„␀␀␀r_␀␀␀Ú	round_refs␀␀␀     r$␀␀␀ÚrecordzHeightArchive.recordé␀␀s(␀␀␀€␀ð␀ u¸Ø°·±ñ%
